`uv run --frozen python tests/eval/run_agent_owl_generator.py` → all 17
staged examples PASS (including the new `staged-double-encoded-payload-
001` scoring `1.000`), staged-contract aggregate `1.000` (threshold
`0.950`); all 10 parsed-corpus cases PASS, aggregate `1.000` (threshold
`0.900`).

### Live verification (read-only, exactly ONE `infer_attributes` call, against the user's own endpoint `benoit_cayla.ontobricks-todrop.monclaudesonnetamoi`)

Rebuilt a `COMPLETING`-stage `GenerateDraft` from the live session
`fastapi_session/b3bd26a3fbe54f89895b0cfcfbff1feb`'s
`domain_data.ontology.classes` (15 real ontology classes, via
`GenerateDraft.build_locked_anchors_from_classes` — read-only, the session
