   Add-candidate "Type hint" `<select>`: relabeled `Class` -> `Entity`,
   `Object Property` -> `Relationship (object property)`, `Data Property`
   -> `Attribute (data property)` (values unchanged). Added a one-line
   `.text-muted.small` hint under the select clarifying that a Relationship
   links two entities while an Attribute stores a single value on one
   entity. Relabeled the Stage 2 "Discard Draft" button to "Discard Draft &
   Start Over" (same `data-action="wizard-review-discard"`, unchanged
